{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' game/games/lanterns/README.md && printf '\\\\n--- logic ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,320p' game/games/lanterns/logic/src/lib.rs && printf '\\\\n--- tests ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,320p' game/games/lanterns/logic/tests/capture.rs && printf '\\\\n--- proof ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,360p' game/games/lanterns/proof.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"# Lanterns Exact\n\nA three-minute third-person game built on Exact's game add-on. Move the animated\nFox with WASD, arrows, or the left side of a touch screen. Jump with Space or the\npurple button and press E or LIGHT within 1.5 metres of a lantern. Push the crate\nto reach the twelfth lantern on the ledge.\n\nFrom the repository root:\n\n```sh\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh test\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh proof\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh build-web\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh dev\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh macos\nsh game/games/lanterns/run.sh ios\n```\n\nThe original Fox.glb from Khronos glTF Sample Models remains unchanged; its\nattribution and licence are next to the asset. Game state, Rapier bodies, input,\ntimer, lanterns, and current animation clip are all included in Exact world saves.\n\n`build-web` also injects the development-only `window.lanterns.command` adapter\nused by the independent comparison harness. It is inert unless the URL contains\n`?agent=1`; the adapter sends platform input into the real Exact surface, advances\nExact's owned clock, and persists the surface's public save carrier in localStorage.\n\nInitial terrain and the twelve-lantern roster live in `scene.json`; repeated lantern\nparts live in `lantern.fragment.json`. Run `bun game/dev.mjs lanterns --scene-only`\nafter content edits, or add `--reuse-baker` to skip Cargo completely once the typed\nbaker exists. Rust behavior remains unchanged. Restart uses the new content;\nContinue/Restore keeps saved progress. See [typed scene usage](../../scene/README.md)\nfor parameters, overrides, asset validation and digest-bound development source links.\n\n--- logic ---\n//! Lanterns: one complete three-minute island game.\n#![deny(missing_docs)]\n#![forbid(unsafe_code)]\n\nuse exact_game::audio::{self, AudioListener, AudioSource, Sounds, Synth};\nuse exact_game::{\n    scene, Actions, Animation, Asset, Bloom, Camera, Component, DirectionalLight, Environment, Fog,\n    Follow, Game, Input, Material, Mesh, Parent, PointLight, Quat, Region, Resource, Spring, Stick,\n    Transform, Vec2, Vec3, World,\n};\nuse exact_game_physics::{self as physics, Body, Character, Collider, Physics};\n\nconst FOX_BYTES: &[u8] = include_bytes!(\"../../assets/Fox.glb\");\nconst DURATION_TICKS: u32 = 180 * 60;\nconst SPAWN: Vec3 = Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 12.0);\n/// Canvas inputs. Action counters let Contract overlay buttons feed distinct\n/// touch presses while the left thumb remains on the raw movement stick.\n#[derive(Default, exact_game::Args)]\npub struct Options {\n    /// Procedural scenery seed.\n    pub seed: u64,\n    /// Whether the title has started this round.\n    #[live]\n    pub started: bool,\n    /// Pause simulation without destroying the world.\n    #[live]\n    pub paused: bool,\n    /// Setup counter; changing it starts a fresh game.\n    pub round: u32,\n    /// Monotonic Contract Jump-button press counter.\n    #[live]\n    pub jump_press: u32,\n    /// Monotonic Contract Light-button press counter.\n    #[live]\n    pub light_press: u32,\n    /// Whether new synthesized sounds may start.\n    #[live]\n    pub sound: bool,\n    /// Baked typed initial conditions; a construction argument, never a live edit.\n    pub scene: String,\n}\n\n/// Player-only saved state.\n#[derive(Default, Component)]\npub struct Player {\n    /// Ground distance carried to the next footstep.\n    pub stride: f32,\n}\n\n/// One saved lightable target.\n#[derive(Default, Component)]\npub struct Lantern {\n    /// Whether this target has been lit.\n    pub lit: bool,\n    /// Deterministic light-on envelope.\n    pub glow: Spring,\n}\n\n/// Saved round state independent of presentation.\n#[derive(Default, Resource)]\npub struct Session {\n    /// Active fixed ticks; pause and terminal states do not add to this.\n    pub elapsed: u32,\n    /// 0 title, 1 playing, 2 won, 3 lost.\n    pub phase: u32,\n    /// Last Contract Jump counter consumed.\n    pub jump_press: u32,\n    /// Last Contract Light counter consumed.\n    pub light_press: u32,\n}\n\n/// The complete Lanterns game behind `surface=world(...)`.\npub struct Lanterns;\n\nimpl Game for Lanterns {\n    const CAPTURE_SUPPORTED: bool = true;\n    const ID: &'static str = \"lanterns\";\n    const SAVE_VERSION: u32 = 2;\n    type Args = Options;\n\n    fn assets() -> &'static [Asset] {\n        static ASSETS: [Asset; 1] = [Asset::glb(\"Fox.glb\", FOX_BYTES)];\n        &ASSETS\n    }\n\n    fn actions() -> Actions {\n        Actions::new()\n            .stick(\"move\", Stick::wasd().or_arrows().or_touch(Region::Left))\n            .button(\"jump\", &[\"Space\"])\n            .button(\"light\", &[\"KeyE\"])\n    }\n\n    fn validate(args: &Options) -> Result<(), String> {\n        scene_types()\n            .prepare(&args.scene, Self::assets())\n            .map(|_| ())\n    }\n\n    fn setup(world: &mut World, args: &Options) {\n        world.reseed(args.seed);\n        physics::register(world);\n        world.register_audio().register_resource::<Session>();\n        world.insert_resource(Session {\n            phase: u32::from(args.started),\n            jump_press: args.jump_press,\n            light_press: args.light_press,\n            ..Session::default()\n        });\n        world.resource_mut::<Physics>().gravity = Vec3::new(0.0, -12.0, 0.0);\n        define_sounds(world);\n        world.insert_resource(Environment {\n            background: None,\n            zenith: [0.08, 0.12, 0.28],\n            horizon: [0.52, 0.22, 0.16],\n            ground: [0.035, 0.025, 0.06],\n            ambient: 0.42,\n            sun_disc: 0.015,\n            exposure: 1.0,\n            fog: Some(Fog {\n                color: Some([0.12, 0.14, 0.24]),\n                density: 0.008,\n                height_falloff: 0.04,\n            }),\n            bloom: Some(Bloom {\n                threshold: 1.0,\n                intensity: 0.8,\n                radius: 1.0,\n            }),\n        });\n        let types = scene_types();\n        types.register(world);\n        types\n            .prepare(&args.scene, Self::assets())\n            .expect(\"validated scene\")\n            .instantiate(world)\n            .expect(\"fresh scene identities\");\n        let player = world.spawn_named(\n            \"player\",\n            (\n                Transform::at(SPAWN.x, SPAWN.y + 0.65, SPAWN.z),\n                Character {\n                    radius: 0.35,\n                    height: 1.3,\n                    step: 0.32,\n                    mass: 80.0,\n                    ..Character::default()\n                },\n                Player::default(),\n            ),\n        );\n        world.spawn_named(\n            \"fox\",\n            (\n                Transform::at(0.0, -0.65, 0.0).with_scale(0.018),\n                Parent(player),\n                Mesh::asset(\"Fox.glb\"),\n                Material::default().rough(0.58),\n                Animation::looping(\"Survey\"),\n            ),\n        );\n        world.spawn_named(\n            \"camera\",\n            (\n                Transform::default(),\n                Camera {\n                    fov_y_degrees: 45.0,\n                    near: 0.08,\n                    far: 100.0,\n                    active: true,\n                },\n                AudioListener,\n                AudioSource {\n                    sound: \"wind\".into(),\n                    gain: 0.22,\n                    playing: true,\n                },\n                Follow::new(player).offset(10.0, 8.5, 14.0).lag(0.12),\n            ),\n        );\n        world.spawn_named(\n            \"sun\",\n            (\n                Transform::at(16.0, 25.0, -18.0).looking_at(Vec3::ZERO, Vec3::Y),\n                DirectionalLight {\n                    color: [1.0, 0.52, 0.24],\n                    illuminance: 3.4,\n                    shadows: true,\n                },\n            ),\n        );\n        spawn_sign(world);\n        spawn_decor(world, args.seed);\n        publish(world);\n    }\n\n    fn paused(args: &Options) -> bool {\n        args.paused || !args.started\n    }\n\n    fn tick(world: &mut World, input: &Input, args: &Options) {\n        let (terminal, jump_button, light_button) = {\n            let mut session = world.resource_mut::<Session>();\n            if session.phase == 0 && args.started {\n                session.phase = 1;\n            }\n            let jump = session.jump_press != args.jump_press;\n            let light = session.light_press != args.light_press;\n            session.jump_press = args.jump_press;\n            session.light_press = args.light_press;\n            (session.phase >= 2, jump, light)\n        };\n        if terminal {\n            publish(world);\n            audio::step(world);\n            return;\n        }\n        world.resource_mut::<Session>().elapsed += 1;\n        let dt = world.dt();\n        let player = world.named(\"player\").unwrap();\n        let jump = jump_button || input.pressed(\"jump\");\n        let direction = input.stick_xz(\"move\");\n        let mut jumped = false;\n        {\n            let mut character = world.get_mut::<Character>(player).unwrap();\n            if jump && character.grounded {\n                character.velocity.y = 6.4;\n                character.grounded = false;\n                jumped = true;\n            } else {\n                character.velocity.y = (character.velocity.y - 12.0 * dt).max(-30.0);\n            }\n        }\n        physics::move_character(world, player, direction * 4.5);\n        physics::step(world);\n        if jumped {\n            world.log(\"jump\");\n            if args.sound {\n                world.play(\"jump\").at(player).start();\n            }\n        }\n        update_player(world, direction, args.sound);\n        if light_button || input.pressed(\"light\") {\n            light_nearest(world, args.sound);\n        }\n        update_lanterns(world);\n        let elapsed = world.resource::<Session>().elapsed;\n        if elapsed >= DURATION_TICKS {\n            world.resource_mut::<Session>().phase = 3;\n            world.log(\"night fell\");\n            if args.sound {\n                world.play(\"night\").start();\n            }\n        }\n        update_sun(world);\n        scene::follow(world);\n        audio::step(world);\n        publish(world);\n    }\n}\n\nfn define_sounds(world: &mut World) {\n    world\n        .resource_mut::<Sounds>()\n        .add(\n            \"footstep\",\n            Synth::noise()\n                .seconds(0.08)\n                .attack(0.002)\n                .release(0.07)\n                .lowpass_hz(720.0)\n                .gain(0.24),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"jump\",\n            Synth::sine(280.0)\n                .seconds(0.12)\n                .attack(0.005)\n                .release(0.1)\n                .gain(0.18),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"chime\",\n            Synth::sine(660.0)\n                .seconds(0.7)\n                .attack(0.005)\n                .release(0.6)\n                .gain(0.28)\n                .layer(Synth::sine(990.0).seconds(0.5).release(0.42).gain(0.14)),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"night\",\n            Synth::sine(160.0)\n                .seconds(1.2)\n                .attack(0.04)\n                .release(1.0)\n                .gain(0.24),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"wind\",\n            Synth::noise()\n                .seconds(2.0)\n                .sustain(1.0)\n                .lowpass_hz(420.0)\n                .gain(0.1)\n                .looped(),\n        );\n}\n\nfn spawn_static_box(world: &mut World, name: &str, at: Vec3, size: Vec3, material: Material) {\n    let mesh = Mesh::cuboid(size);\n    world.spawn_named(\n        name,\n        (\n            Transform::at(at.x, at.y, at.z),\n            mesh.clone(),\n            material,\n            Collider::of(&mesh),\n        ),\n    );\n}\n\n--- tests ---\n//! Simulation reproduction of the public native route; normalized inputs, not a UI claim.\nuse exact_game::{Args, Capture, CaptureLimits, Sim, Transform, Value};\nuse exact_game_physics::Character;\nuse lanterns_logic::{Lantern, Lanterns, Options, Session};\n\nfn ticks(sim: &mut Sim<Lanterns>, count: u32) {\n    let before = sim.world().tick();\n    let reply = sim.agent(&format!(r#\"{{\"op\":\"clock\",\"ticks\":{count}}}\"#));\n    assert!(!reply.contains(\"error\"), \"{reply}\");\n    assert_eq!(sim.world().tick(), before + count as u64);\n}\nfn hold(sim: &mut Sim<Lanterns>, code: &str, count: u32) {\n    sim.key_down(code);\n    ticks(sim, count);\n    sim.key_up(code);\n}\nfn press(sim: &mut Sim<Lanterns>, name: &str) {\n    let index = <Options as Args>::FIELDS\n        .iter()\n        .position(|(field, _)| *field == name)\n        .unwrap();\n    let mut values = sim.args().values();\n    let Value::Number(value) = &mut values[index] else {\n        panic!(\"counter\")\n    };\n    *value += 1.0;\n    sim.bind(&values, None).unwrap();\n}\nfn steer(sim: &mut Sim<Lanterns>, x: f32, z: f32, tolerance: f32) {\n    for _ in 0..160 {\n        let at = sim.position(\"player\").unwrap();\n        let dx = x - at.x;\n        let dz = z - at.z;\n        if dx.hypot(dz) <= tolerance {\n            return;\n        }\n        let x_axis = dx.abs() >= dz.abs();\n        let gap = if x_axis { dx } else { dz };\n        let key = if x_axis {\n            if gap > 0.0 {\n                \"KeyD\"\n            } else {\n                \"KeyA\"\n            }\n        } else if gap > 0.0 {\n            \"KeyS\"\n        } else {\n            \"KeyW\"\n        };\n        let count =\n            (((gap.abs() - tolerance * 0.45).max(0.075) / 0.075).floor() as u32).clamp(1, 10);\n        hold(sim, key, count);\n        ticks(sim, 1);\n    }\n    panic!(\n        \"route stalled toward {x},{z} at {:?}\",\n        sim.position(\"player\")\n    );\n}\nfn land(sim: &mut Sim<Lanterns>, floor: f32) {\n    for _ in 0..72 {\n        if sim.world().get::<Character>(\"player\").unwrap().grounded\n            && sim.position(\"player\").unwrap().y - 0.65 > floor\n        {\n            return;\n        }\n        ticks(sim, 1);\n    }\n    panic!(\"landing failed at {:?}\", sim.position(\"player\"));\n}\n#[test]\nfn crate_checkpoint_finishes_route_twice_and_restores_terminal_state() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::<Lanterns>::new(Options {\n        seed: 1_041_003,\n        started: true,\n        sound: true,\n        scene: exact_game_scene::bake::compile(\n            std::path::Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../scene.json\"),\n            &lanterns_logic::scene_types(),\n            <Lanterns as exact_game::Game>::assets(),\n        )\n        .unwrap()\n        .content,\n        ..Default::default()\n    })\n    .unwrap();\n    ticks(&mut sim, 2);\n    steer(&mut sim, -8.0, 12.0, 0.18);\n    for index in 1..=11 {\n        let name = format!(\"lantern-{index}\");\n        let at = sim\n            .world()\n            .get::<Transform>(name.as_str())\n            .unwrap()\n            .position;\n        steer(&mut sim, at.x, at.z, 0.18);\n        press(&mut sim, \"light_press\");\n        ticks(&mut sim, 2);\n        assert!(sim.world().get::<Lantern>(name.as_str()).unwrap().lit);\n    }\n    steer(&mut sim, 4.8, 8.0, 0.14);\n    let before = sim.position(\"crate\").unwrap();\n    hold(&mut sim, \"KeyD\", 65);\n    ticks(&mut sim, 15);\n    let at = sim.position(\"crate\").unwrap();\n    assert!(\n        at.x > before.x + 0.25 && at.x < 7.55 && (at.z - 8.0).abs() < 0.22,\n        \"{at:?}\"\n    );\n    sim.start_capture(\n        \"test-executable:lanterns-route\",\n        CaptureLimits {\n            bytes: 8 * 1024 * 1024,\n            ..Default::default()\n        },\n    )\n    .unwrap();\n    steer(&mut sim, at.x - 1.5, at.z, 0.11);\n    press(&mut sim, \"jump_press\");\n    hold(&mut sim, \"KeyD\", 20);\n    land(&mut sim, 0.9);\n    assert!(\n        (sim.position(\"player\").unwrap().y - 0.65 - (sim.position(\"crate\").unwrap().y + 0.6)).abs()\n            < 0.18\n    );\n    press(&mut sim, \"jump_press\");\n    hold(&mut sim, \"KeyD\", 35);\n    land(&mut sim, 2.2);\n    steer(&mut sim, 10.0, 8.0, 0.18);\n    press(&mut sim, \"light_press\");\n    ticks(&mut sim, 2);\n    assert_eq!(sim.world().resource::<Session>().phase, 2);\n    assert_eq!(\n        sim.world()\n            .query::<&Lantern>()\n            .iter()\n            .filter(|(_, l)| l.lit)\n            .count(),\n        12\n    );\n    let hash = sim.world().hash();\n    let capture = Capture::from_bytes(&sim.stop_capture().unwrap().to_bytes()).unwrap();\n    for _ in 0..2 {\n        let replay =\n            Sim::<Lanterns>::replay_capture(&capture, \"test-executable:lanterns-route\", None)\n                .unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(replay.world().hash(), hash);\n        assert_eq!(replay.world().resource::<Session>().phase, 2);\n    }\n    let terminal = sim.save();\n    let restored = Sim::<Lanterns>::from_save(&terminal).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(restored.world().hash(), hash);\n    sim.start_capture(\"test-executable:lanterns-route\", CaptureLimits::default())\n        .unwrap();\n    ticks(&mut sim, 10);\n    let terminal_capture = sim.stop_capture().unwrap();\n    let replay =\n        Sim::<Lanterns>::replay_capture(terminal_capture, \"test-executable:lanterns-route\", None)\n            .unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(replay.world().resource::<Session>().phase, 2);\n}\n\n--- proof ---\n#!/usr/bin/env bun\nimport { resolve } from 'node:path';\nimport { proof } from '../../proof.mjs';\nimport { installAdapter } from './inject-adapter.mjs';\n\nawait proof(import.meta, async ({open, check, equal, out, host}) => {\n  if (host === 'web') installAdapter(resolve(import.meta.dirname, 'dist'));\n  const node = (tree, id) => tree.nodes.find(item => item.props?.testId === id);\n  const s = await open();\n  const title = await s.tree();\n  check('accessible Play overlays a real title-paused world at tick zero',\n    node(title, 'play')?.focused === true && node(title, 'world')?.world?.tick === 0);\n  await s.tap('play');\n  const playing = await s.tree();\n  check('the world and distinct Light and Jump controls are mounted',\n    !!node(playing, 'world') && !!node(playing, 'light') && !!node(playing, 'jump'));\n  const foxMesh = await s.world('world').get('fox', 'Mesh');\n  const foxAnimation = await s.world('world').get('fox', 'Animation');\n  check('the consumer uses the real Fox asset', equal(foxMesh, {Asset:['Fox.glb']}), foxMesh);\n  check('the Fox begins in the Survey clip', foxAnimation?.clip === 'Survey', foxAnimation);\n  await s.world('world').hold('KeyW', 1000);\n  const moved = await s.world('world').position('player');\n  const run = await s.world('world').get('fox', 'Animation');\n  check('one second of W moves 4.5 metres through real physics',\n    Math.abs(moved[2] - 7.5) < 0.08, moved);\n  check('movement selects and advances Run', run?.clip === 'Run' && run.seconds > 0, run);\n  await s.screenshot(resolve(out, 'lanterns-fox.png'));\n  const logs = await s.logs();\n  check('the browser and GPU report no errors',\n    !logs.host?.some(line => /^(exception:|console\\.error:|error:)/.test(line)), logs.host);\n  await s.close();\n});\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The current logic still marks the session won inside lantern lighting, and the existing route test asserts that immediate terminal state. I’m tracing the HUD/publication and save-state shape now so the new “all lit, return home” phase is visible and durable without touching movement or geometry."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '260,760p' game/games/lanterns/logic/src/lib.rs && printf '\\\\n--- contract ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,360p' game/games/lanterns/app.contract && printf '\\\\n--- app json ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,240p' game/games/lanterns/app.json && printf '\\\\n--- all phase/win/hud refs ---\\\\n' && rg -n \\\"phase|won|win|lit|return|home|instruction|elapsed|remaining|lantern\\\" game/games/lanterns --glob '\"'!assets/Fox.glb'\"' --glob '\"'!artifacts/**'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '260,760p' game/games/lanterns/logic/src/lib.rs && printf '\\\\n--- contract ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,360p' game/games/lanterns/app.contract && printf '\\\\n--- app json ---\\\\n' && sed -n '1,240p' game/games/lanterns/app.json && printf '\\\\n--- all phase/win/hud refs ---\\\\n' && rg -n \\\"phase|won|win|lit|return|home|instruction|elapsed|remaining|lantern\\\" game/games/lanterns --glob '\"'!assets/Fox.glb'\"' --glob '\"'!artifacts/**'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"\nfn define_sounds(world: &mut World) {\n    world\n        .resource_mut::<Sounds>()\n        .add(\n            \"footstep\",\n            Synth::noise()\n                .seconds(0.08)\n                .attack(0.002)\n                .release(0.07)\n                .lowpass_hz(720.0)\n                .gain(0.24),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"jump\",\n            Synth::sine(280.0)\n                .seconds(0.12)\n                .attack(0.005)\n                .release(0.1)\n                .gain(0.18),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"chime\",\n            Synth::sine(660.0)\n                .seconds(0.7)\n                .attack(0.005)\n                .release(0.6)\n                .gain(0.28)\n                .layer(Synth::sine(990.0).seconds(0.5).release(0.42).gain(0.14)),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"night\",\n            Synth::sine(160.0)\n                .seconds(1.2)\n                .attack(0.04)\n                .release(1.0)\n                .gain(0.24),\n        )\n        .add(\n            \"wind\",\n            Synth::noise()\n                .seconds(2.0)\n                .sustain(1.0)\n                .lowpass_hz(420.0)\n                .gain(0.1)\n                .looped(),\n        );\n}\n\nfn spawn_static_box(world: &mut World, name: &str, at: Vec3, size: Vec3, material: Material) {\n    let mesh = Mesh::cuboid(size);\n    world.spawn_named(\n        name,\n        (\n            Transform::at(at.x, at.y, at.z),\n            mesh.clone(),\n            material,\n            Collider::of(&mesh),\n        ),\n    );\n}\n\nfn spawn_sign(world: &mut World) {\n    spawn_static_box(\n        world,\n        \"sign-post\",\n        Vec3::new(3.0, 0.85, 10.0),\n        Vec3::new(0.18, 1.7, 0.18),\n        Material::rgb(0.32, 0.18, 0.08),\n    );\n    spawn_static_box(\n        world,\n        \"sign-board\",\n        Vec3::new(3.0, 1.55, 10.0),\n        Vec3::new(2.5, 0.9, 0.14),\n        Material::rgb(0.36, 0.21, 0.1),\n    );\n}\n\nfn spawn_decor(world: &mut World, seed: u64) {\n    world.reseed(seed);\n    let before: Vec<_> = world.entities().collect();\n    for i in 0..18 {\n        let angle = world.rand(0.0..std::f32::consts::TAU);\n        let radius = world.rand(13.0..16.5);\n        let x = angle.cos() * radius;\n        let z = angle.sin() * radius;\n        let trunk = world.spawn_named(\n            format!(\"tree-{i}\"),\n            (\n                Transform::at(x, 1.05, z),\n                Mesh::cylinder(0.17, 2.1),\n                Material::rgb(0.19, 0.12, 0.07),\n            ),\n        );\n        world.spawn((\n            Transform::at(0.0, 2.15, 0.0).with_scale(Vec3::new(1.0, 1.6, 1.0)),\n            Parent(trunk),\n            Mesh::cylinder(1.15, 2.4),\n            Material::rgb(0.04, 0.17, 0.1).rough(0.9),\n        ));\n    }\n    for i in 0..22 {\n        let angle = world.rand(0.0..std::f32::consts::TAU);\n        let radius = world.rand(14.0..17.0);\n        world.spawn_named(\n            format!(\"rock-{i}\"),\n            (\n                Transform::at(angle.cos() * radius, 0.2, angle.sin() * radius).with_scale(\n                    Vec3::new(\n                        world.rand(0.4..1.0),\n                        world.rand(0.2..0.6),\n                        world.rand(0.4..1.0),\n                    ),\n                ),\n                Mesh::sphere(0.5),\n                Material::rgb(0.24, 0.25, 0.3).rough(0.95),\n            ),\n        );\n    }\n    let generated: Vec<_> = world.entities().filter(|e| !before.contains(e)).collect();\n    for entity in generated {\n        world.insert(\n            entity,\n            exact_game_scene::GeneratedBy {\n                generator: \"lanterns::spawn_decor\".into(),\n                parameters: [\n                    (\"seed\".into(), seed.to_string()),\n                    (\"trees\".into(), \"18\".into()),\n                    (\"rocks\".into(), \"22\".into()),\n                ]\n                .into(),\n            },\n        );\n    }\n}\n\nfn update_player(world: &mut World, direction: Vec3, sound: bool) {\n    let player = world.named(\"player\").unwrap();\n    let (grounded, velocity) = {\n        let character = world.get::<Character>(player).unwrap();\n        (character.grounded, character.velocity)\n    };\n    let speed = Vec2::new(velocity.x, velocity.z).length();\n    let clip = if !grounded || speed >= 2.8 {\n        \"Run\"\n    } else if speed > 0.08 {\n        \"Walk\"\n    } else {\n        \"Survey\"\n    };\n    let fox = world.named(\"fox\").unwrap();\n    {\n        let mut animation = world.get_mut::<Animation>(fox).unwrap();\n        animation.play(clip);\n        animation.advance(world.dt());\n    }\n    if direction.length_squared() > 0.0025 {\n        let yaw = direction.x.atan2(-direction.z);\n        world.get_mut::<Transform>(fox).unwrap().rotation = Quat::from_rotation_y(yaw);\n    }\n    if grounded && speed > 0.08 {\n        let mut footsteps = 0;\n        {\n            let mut state = world.get_mut::<Player>(player).unwrap();\n            state.stride += speed * world.dt();\n            while state.stride >= 0.7 {\n                state.stride -= 0.7;\n                footsteps += 1;\n            }\n        }\n        if sound {\n            for _ in 0..footsteps {\n                world.play(\"footstep\").at(player).start();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    let feet = world.get::<Transform>(player).unwrap().position.y - 0.65;\n    if feet < -6.0 {\n        let mut pose = *world.get::<Transform>(player).unwrap();\n        pose.position = SPAWN + Vec3::Y * 0.65;\n        world.teleport(player, pose);\n        let mut c = world.get_mut::<Character>(player).unwrap();\n        c.velocity = Vec3::ZERO;\n        c.grounded = false;\n        world.log(\"fall reset\");\n    }\n}\n\nfn light_nearest(world: &mut World, sound: bool) {\n    let center = world.get::<Transform>(\"player\").unwrap().position - Vec3::Y * 0.65;\n    let mut nearest = None;\n    let mut distance = 1.5f32;\n    for (entity, (pose, lantern)) in world.query::<(&Transform, &Lantern)>().iter() {\n        if lantern.lit {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let d = pose.position.distance(center);\n        if d <= distance {\n            distance = d;\n            nearest = Some(entity);\n        }\n    }\n    let Some(entity) = nearest else { return };\n    {\n        let mut lantern = world.get_mut::<Lantern>(entity).unwrap();\n        lantern.lit = true;\n        lantern.glow.set_target(world.now(), 1.0);\n    }\n    let name = world.name(entity).unwrap().to_owned();\n    world.log(format_args!(\"{name} lit\"));\n    if sound {\n        world.play(\"chime\").at(entity).start();\n    }\n    let count = world\n        .query::<&Lantern>()\n        .iter()\n        .filter(|(_, l)| l.lit)\n        .count();\n    if count == world.query::<&Lantern>().iter().count() {\n        world.resource_mut::<Session>().phase = 2;\n        world.log(\"all lanterns lit\");\n    }\n}\n\nfn update_lanterns(world: &mut World) {\n    let now = world.now();\n    let rows: Vec<_> = world\n        .query::<&Lantern>()\n        .iter()\n        .map(|(e, l)| (world.name(e).unwrap().to_owned(), l.glow.value(now)))\n        .collect();\n    for (name, glow) in rows {\n        let bulb = world.named(&format!(\"{name}/bulb\")).unwrap();\n        world.get_mut::<Material>(bulb).unwrap().emissive = [glow * 4.0, glow * 1.65, glow * 0.32];\n        world.get_mut::<PointLight>(bulb).unwrap().intensity = glow * 5.0;\n    }\n}\n\nfn update_sun(world: &mut World) {\n    let progress = world.resource::<Session>().elapsed as f32 / DURATION_TICKS as f32;\n    let angle = 0.22 - progress * 0.52;\n    let position = Vec3::new(24.0 * angle.cos(), 24.0 * angle.sin() + 4.0, -18.0);\n    *world.get_mut::<Transform>(\"sun\").unwrap() =\n        Transform::at(position.x, position.y, position.z).looking_at(Vec3::ZERO, Vec3::Y);\n}\n\nfn publish(world: &mut World) {\n    let count = world\n        .query::<&Lantern>()\n        .iter()\n        .filter(|(_, l)| l.lit)\n        .count() as u32;\n    let session = world.resource::<Session>();\n    let remaining = DURATION_TICKS.saturating_sub(session.elapsed).div_ceil(60);\n    let phase = match session.phase {\n        0 => \"title\",\n        1 => \"playing\",\n        2 => \"won\",\n        _ => \"lost\",\n    };\n    drop(session);\n    world.publish(\"count\", count);\n    world.publish(\"total\", world.query::<&Lantern>().iter().count() as u32);\n    world.publish(\"remaining\", remaining);\n    world.publish(\"phase\", phase);\n    world.publish(\"assetReady\", true);\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use exact_game::Sim;\n\n    fn game() -> Sim<Lanterns> {\n        Sim::new(Options {\n            scene: bake_scene().content,\n            seed: 1_041_003,\n            started: true,\n            sound: true,\n            ..Options::default()\n        })\n        .unwrap()\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn level_has_matching_player_crate_obstacles_and_twelve_targets() {\n        let sim = game();\n        let world = sim.world();\n        assert_eq!(world.query::<&Lantern>().iter().count(), 12);\n        assert_eq!(\n            world.get::<Transform>(\"crate\").unwrap().position,\n            Vec3::new(6.0, 0.6, 8.0)\n        );\n        assert_eq!(\n            world.get::<Transform>(\"lantern-12\").unwrap().position,\n            Vec3::new(10.0, 2.4, 8.0)\n        );\n        assert!(world.has::<Animation>(world.named(\"fox\").unwrap()));\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn one_second_moves_at_four_point_five_and_selects_run() {\n        let mut sim = game();\n        sim.key_down(\"KeyW\");\n        sim.run(1000.0);\n        sim.key_up(\"KeyW\");\n        let pose = sim.world().get::<Transform>(\"player\").unwrap();\n        assert!(\n            (pose.position.z - 7.5).abs() < 0.08,\n            \"z={}\",\n            pose.position.z\n        );\n        assert_eq!(sim.world().get::<Animation>(\"fox\").unwrap().clip, \"Run\");\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn save_restores_dynamic_body_timer_animation_and_lights() {\n        let mut sim = game();\n        sim.run(100.0);\n        let bytes = sim.save();\n        let hash = sim.world().hash();\n        let mut restored = game();\n        restored.restore(&bytes).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(restored.world().hash(), hash);\n        assert_eq!(restored.world().resource::<Session>().elapsed, 6);\n        assert_eq!(\n            restored.world().get::<Animation>(\"fox\").unwrap().clip,\n            \"Survey\"\n        );\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn no_input_loses_at_exactly_three_minutes() {\n        let mut sim = game();\n        sim.run(180_000.0);\n        assert_eq!(sim.world().resource::<Session>().phase, 3);\n        assert_eq!(sim.world().resource::<Session>().elapsed, DURATION_TICKS);\n    }\n}\n\n/// Scene type selection; every field/default/variant comes from these Rust declarations.\npub fn scene_types() -> exact_game_scene::Types {\n    let mut types = exact_game_scene::Types::standard();\n    types\n        .component::<Lantern>()\n        .component::<Collider>()\n        .component::<Body>();\n    types\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nfn bake_scene() -> exact_game_scene::bake::Baked {\n    exact_game_scene::bake::compile(\n        std::path::Path::new(env!(\"CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR\")).join(\"../scene.json\"),\n        &scene_types(),\n        Lanterns::assets(),\n    )\n    .unwrap()\n}\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod scene_tests;\n\n--- contract ---\nuse sceneContent from \"./.scene/scene.contract\"\n\nshape Hud\n  count: number\n  total: number\n  remaining: number\n  phase: string\n\ncomponent Lanterns\n  state started = false\n  state seed = 1041003\n  state paused = false\n  state round = 0\n  state jumpPress = 0\n  state lightPress = 0\n  state sound = true\n  state saveRequest = 0\n  state loadRequest = 0\n  state checkpointStatus = \"\"\n  resource hud = exactSurface(\"world\") as shape Hud\n\n  action play writes started\n    started = true\n  action togglePause writes paused\n    paused = not paused\n  action toggleSound writes sound\n    sound = not sound\n  action jump writes jumpPress\n    jumpPress = jumpPress + 1\n  action light writes lightPress\n    lightPress = lightPress + 1\n  action restart writes round, paused\n    round = round + 1\n    paused = false\n  action saveGame writes saveRequest, checkpointStatus\n    saveRequest = saveRequest + 1\n    checkpointStatus = \"Saving…\"\n  action loadGame writes loadRequest, checkpointStatus\n    loadRequest = loadRequest + 1\n    checkpointStatus = \"Loading…\"\n  action checkpoint(value: string) writes checkpointStatus, started\n    if value == \"surface-save:saved\"\n      checkpointStatus = \"Saved\"\n    if value == \"surface-load:loaded\"\n      checkpointStatus = \"Loaded\"\n      started = true\n    if value == \"surface-save:error\"\n      checkpointStatus = \"Save failed\"\n    if value == \"surface-load:error\"\n      checkpointStatus = \"No compatible save\"\n\n  view\n    main width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" background-color=\"#130f24\" color=\"#fff4d6\"\n      canvas surface=world(seed, started, paused, round, jumpPress, lightPress, sound, sceneContent()) surface-save=saveRequest surface-load=loadRequest message=checkpoint testId=\"world\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" position=\"relative\" overflow=\"hidden\"\n        when started\n          row position=\"absolute\" top=18 left=18 right=18 justify-content=\"space-between\" align-items=\"center\" flex-wrap=\"wrap\" gap=8\n            text `LANTERNS ${hud.count} / ${hud.total}` aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"hud-lanterns\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=20 font-weight=700\n            text `TIME ${hud.remaining}` aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"hud-time\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=20 font-weight=600\n            row gap=8\n              button press=toggleSound testId=\"sound\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n                text (sound ? \"Sound on\" : \"Sound off\") color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=16\n              button press=saveGame testId=\"save\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n                text \"Save\" color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=16\n              button press=loadGame testId=\"load-save\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n                text \"Load\" color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=16\n              button press=togglePause testId=\"pause\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n                text (paused ? \"Resume\" : \"Pause\") color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=16\n            when checkpointStatus != \"\"\n              text checkpointStatus aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"save-status\" padding=10 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\n          text \"Move: WASD / arrows / left thumb\" position=\"absolute\" bottom=22 left=22 padding=12 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#d6cdec\" font-size=15\n          text \"Push the crate beside the high ledge. Jump onto it, then jump again.\" testId=\"sign-instruction\" position=\"absolute\" bottom=76 left=22 right=22 padding=12 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\n          row position=\"absolute\" bottom=22 right=22 gap=14 align-items=\"flex-end\"\n            button press=light testId=\"light\" width=92 height=92 display=\"flex\" border-radius=46 background-color=\"#ffb43b\" justify-content=\"center\" align-items=\"center\"\n              text \"LIGHT\" width=\"100%\" text-align=\"center\" color=\"#241531\" font-size=17 font-weight=700\n            button press=jump testId=\"jump\" width=92 height=92 display=\"flex\" border-radius=46 background-color=\"#a78cff\" justify-content=\"center\" align-items=\"center\"\n              text \"JUMP\" width=\"100%\" text-align=\"center\" color=\"#171126\" font-size=17 font-weight=700\n          when paused\n            column testId=\"paused\" position=\"absolute\" top=\"34%\" left=\"30%\" width=\"40%\" padding=26 align-items=\"center\" gap=18 border-radius=14 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n              text \"Paused\" font-size=34 font-weight=700 color=\"#ffd27a\"\n              text \"Your 180 seconds are frozen.\" font-size=17 color=\"#d6cdec\"\n              button press=togglePause testId=\"resume\" padding=16 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#ffd27a\"\n                text \"Resume\" font-size=19 color=\"#241531\"\n          when hud.phase == \"won\"\n            column testId=\"victory\" position=\"absolute\" top=\"28%\" left=\"24%\" width=\"52%\" padding=30 align-items=\"center\" gap=18 border-radius=14 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n              text \"The island is glowing\" aria-live=\"polite\" font-size=34 color=\"#ffd27a\" font-weight=700\n              text \"All twelve lanterns are lit.\" font-size=18 color=\"#fff4d6\"\n              button press=restart testId=\"again\" padding=16 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#ffd27a\"\n                text \"Play again\" font-size=19 color=\"#241531\"\n          when hud.phase == \"lost\"\n            column testId=\"lost\" position=\"absolute\" top=\"28%\" left=\"24%\" width=\"52%\" padding=30 align-items=\"center\" gap=18 border-radius=14 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n              text \"Night fell\" aria-live=\"polite\" font-size=34 color=\"#ffd27a\" font-weight=700\n              text `You lit ${hud.count} of 12 lanterns.` font-size=18 color=\"#fff4d6\"\n              button press=restart testId=\"retry\" padding=16 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#ffd27a\"\n                text \"Try again\" font-size=19 color=\"#241531\"\n        else\n          column testId=\"title\" position=\"absolute\" top=0 left=0 width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" align-items=\"center\" justify-content=\"center\" gap=24 background-color=\"#130f24\"\n            text \"LANTERNS\" font-size=64 font-weight=700 color=\"#ffd27a\"\n            text \"Light twelve lanterns before the last three minutes of dusk run out.\" font-size=20 color=\"#fff4d6\"\n            text \"Push the crate to reach the lantern on the stone ledge.\" font-size=17 color=\"#d6cdec\"\n            text \"WASD or arrows · Space to jump · E to light\" font-size=15 color=\"#a99fc1\"\n            row gap=12\n              button press=play autofocus testId=\"play\" padding=18 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#ffd27a\"\n                text \"Play\" font-size=22 font-weight=700 color=\"#241531\"\n              button press=loadGame testId=\"title-load\" padding=18 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\"\n                text \"Load save\" font-size=22 font-weight=700 color=\"#ffd27a\"\n            when checkpointStatus != \"\"\n              text checkpointStatus aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"title-save-status\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=15\n\n--- app json ---\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"../../../scripts/app.schema.json\",\n  \"name\": \"Lanterns Exact\",\n  \"short_name\": \"Lanterns\",\n  \"id\": \"com.exact.lanterns.exact\",\n  \"start_url\": \"/\",\n  \"display\": \"standalone\",\n  \"theme_color\": \"#130f24\",\n  \"background_color\": \"#130f24\",\n  \"app\": { \"id\": \"com.exact.lanterns.exact\", \"name\": \"Lanterns Exact\" },\n  \"host\": {\n    \"macos\": { \"minimumOS\": \"14.0\", \"window\": { \"width\": 1280, \"height\": 720 } },\n    \"ios\": { \"minimumOS\": \"17.0\", \"deviceFamily\": [\"iphone\", \"ipad\"] },\n    \"web\": {}\n  },\n  \"game\": { \"crate\": \"lanterns-logic\", \"type\": \"Lanterns\" },\n  \"rust\": false,\n  \"deploy\": { \"store\": { \"web\": \"0\", \"macos\": \"0\", \"ios\": \"0\", \"linux\": \"0\" } }\n}\n\n--- all phase/win/hud refs ---\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:6:  remaining: number\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:7:  phase: string\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:57:            text `LANTERNS ${hud.count} / ${hud.total}` aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"hud-lanterns\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=20 font-weight=700\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:58:            text `TIME ${hud.remaining}` aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"hud-time\" padding=13 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#fff4d6\" font-size=20 font-weight=600\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:69:              text checkpointStatus aria-live=\"polite\" testId=\"save-status\" padding=10 border-radius=9 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:71:          text \"Push the crate beside the high ledge. Jump onto it, then jump again.\" testId=\"sign-instruction\" position=\"absolute\" bottom=76 left=22 right=22 padding=12 border-radius=10 background-color=\"#1b1730\" color=\"#ffd27a\" font-size=14\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:83:          when hud.phase == \"won\"\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:85:              text \"The island is glowing\" aria-live=\"polite\" font-size=34 color=\"#ffd27a\" font-weight=700\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:86:              text \"All twelve lanterns are lit.\" font-size=18 color=\"#fff4d6\"\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:89:          when hud.phase == \"lost\"\ngame/games/lanterns/app.contract:91:              text \"Night f